  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/842/236/taxfc.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:320px;display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eeV3kdIRHKw\" width=\"320\" height=\"179\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>總覽：</strong></p><p>未來城市是一款旨在添加一座未來都市的Minecraft地圖。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/842/237/taxfc.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>更新：</strong></p><p>新增堡壘結構。</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1104/947/taxfc-07-png.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>特色：</strong></p><p>隱藏秘密、機械自動化、光線組裝，以及一座探索未來的雲霄飛車。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/842/238/taxfc.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>安裝方式：</strong></p><p>將.zip檔案拖曳至「.minecraft」資料夾內的saves資料夾中。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/842/239/taxfc.png\" alt=\"螢幕截圖縮圖\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>資訊：</strong></p><p>此地圖由Zeemo製作。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/future-city-3149015/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/842/240/taxfc.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>致謝：</strong></p><p>由Zeemo製作，Taknax改寫。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/taknax/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/805/339/taxfc.png\"></a></p>",
